{"v":4,"catch":"安全帶扣好，燃燒吧郵務車，送件時間到！最多可與三名朋友一起同樂，在互動沙盒世界中手忙腳亂完成任務。嘗試投遞最拚命，完全可靠快遞服務掛保證！","desc":"功能：\n \n 本機與線上多人遊玩：自己一手包辦，保護郵件安全，或者加入三五好友，考驗你們分工合作的能力。\n \n 控制得宜的彈跳混亂：無法預測的破娃娃物理融合活潑的平台遊戲。輕鬆衝刺、跳躍、俯衝和亂抓，但如果撞到東西，就會昏死過去！\n \n 精彩世界：休息一下不送件，到處探索玩樂！遊戲裡到處是玩具、車輛與機器，用來工作或玩樂都可以。\n \n 阿貓阿狗大集合：自訂你的藍領工人，捲起袖子認真幹，送件時間到！","publisher":"Atari","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["動作","冒險","模擬","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人 · 網路 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":4,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 4.7GB / Switch 4.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2f067dfd875a49fad214a675ea01f77ad265d495a8ac75b1a684be9312ed8dbe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/da9d4051933c87ef5b3dcf72c9dde6b9def560abfb247e792d4a5b766f34a195.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7ca90c78d8badac06dc278f8606ad22929e27dfad6604c344a13e0aaab678e85.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bc4d5dadf6e82275d6e3218e24c1fabea805cc669502dd3d90124cfd8d79286a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fa8ba8beec15f1cf205a2aa6a7c5a92bb43f2d9d5b9bd030389e03f8d3849c07.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/04242511e846cd4e251f4992615a61ad8ae5a733bf5d3ae2a376b065584198be.jpg"],"titleId":"0100512010728000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000019534","name":"Dress Code","img":"c13f9f4282195c8ee056156e913dbf37455b67e76f1a74f00f1f8ce3d2da44a6","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000019535","name":"CyberFunk","img":"d6943df32ebde25628ec53fc6d0ff6a4fd3c238ec09b500fdab4849a05db79e0","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000019536","name":"Stunt Sets","img":"41c5fea95178fd7f6fd21af4fe2d0f27def028ab090d928054982df6c0825a5b","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000063761","name":"Totally Reliable Delivery Service - Atari Attire","img":"d61ff21fa5aedb1ff30f912e9ac9d8dee0e5c82fa856295ef3d0ce37853dddab","date":"2025-10-23","mem":false},{"id":"70050000068766","name":"Totally Reliable Delivery Service - Mascot Mayhem","i